n\nAround here, there's always another Rift on the horizon.\n\nStep inside, conquer the challenge, bring home better loot, become stronger... then do it all again.\n\n{2505685783194274}\n\nRest while you can.\n\nIt won't be long before you're heading back out.\n\n{2931613547335456}\n\nOne last thing...\n\nEvery week brings something new.\n\nNew places.\n\nNew gear.\n\nNew trouble.\n\n{2726092177792254}\n\nIf you've got ideas, or just want to swap stories, come find us in the Raider Legends Discord:\n\n**https://discord.gg/AbjjjcSgyG**\n\nSee you around, kid.\n\n\u2014 Gawk", "short_description": "Team up with friends, conquer ever-changing adventures, discover powerful loot, and become stronger with every run. There's always another Rift waiting."}]}, "developer_name": "Gun Raiders Entertainment Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gunraiders.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gunraiders.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Gun Raiders Entertainment Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://gunraiders.zendesk.com/hc/en-us", "website_url": "https://gunraiders.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "27708281278791800"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "no